proceedings|REVIEW: Court process and activities of a formal gathering keep distinct source ordinals and plural-only grammar. No guilt, penalty or jurisdiction is asserted; legal Vietnamese terminology and document-related uses remain unresolved.
spiral|REVIEW: Everyday winding shape covers the supplied cylinder-style observation while the example is a flat widening line. Formal spiral-versus-helix scope needs owner review; no mathematical theorem or DNA claim is introduced.
weekend|PASS: Common Saturday/Sunday usage is qualified by schedule and place. British at and American on variants are described without banning other varieties; the grandparents' fence example translates the completed activity naturally.
craft|REVIEW: Handmade objects, making verb, occupation, vessel and skill retain all five source ordinals. Invariant vessel plural is checked. The bookbinding EN rewards versus VI requires mismatch needs an additive example overlay and full-batch re-review.
electronics|REVIEW: Device collection and field of study preserve separate ordinals. Singular agreement applies to the subject field; replace the devices grammar's unhelpful final-s commentary with useful collocations through an overlay.
